Package: UrbanSprawl
Title: Simulate Urban Land-Use Expansion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("XW", "Lou", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Simulates spatial urban land-use expansion from raster-based
    land-use data using user-defined urban classes and expansion
    scenarios. The package provides stochastic spatial simulation
    tools for exploring patterns of urban growth and sprawl.
